  "description": "U.S. Coast Guard aircrews rescue a hunter reported missing near Wales, Alaska Sept. 13, 2023. A Coast Guard HC-130 Hercules aircrew from Air Station Kodiak dropped survival equipment before a Coast Guard MH-60 Jayhawk helicopter crew from Forward Operating Station Kotzebue safely hoisted the hunter and transported him to the Wales airport for medical treatment. (U.S. Coast Guard video by Air Station Kodiak, edited by Petty Officer 2nd Class John Hightower)",
